  "job_B3.4.15.1_20251003_114732": {
    "text": "Usse lareowas & usse leorneras & \u00fea halgan apostolas & ure bisceopas beoda\u00fe eallum \u00fe\u00e6m\n\u00deonne \u00e6rest we beoda\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ge god don & yfel forl\u00e6ten, & lufia\u00fe eowerne drihten & eowre \u00fea nyhstan,\n& \u00fea \u00f0e nu swylcera synna andetnessa & rihte d\u00e6dbote her ne do\u00fe, hi \u00feonne mid deofle gesiga\u00fe on\nNu bidde we eow & myndgia\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ge don so\u00f0e d\u00e6dbote eowra synna, for \u00feon hell hafa\u00f0 seofon witu:\n& se preost se \u00fee h\u00e6bbe nunnan o\u00f0 his ende, o\u00f0\u00f0e l\u00e6wde man se \u00fee h\u00e6bbe cyfese ofer his \u00e6we, o\u00f0\u00f0e\nNe gesinge \u00fe\u00e6r nan man nane m\u00e6ssan \u00fe\u00e6r hi inne syn, ne husl ne gehalgodne hlaf ne sylle, ne hi nan\n& gif \u00f0a m\u00e6ssepreostas \u00feissa \u00e6nig mid him witon & nella\u00fe him styran & forbeodan hira unriht, o\u00f0\u00f0e\nWa, la, \u00feam mannum \u00fee mid deoflum sculon habban hyra eardungstowe, \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 sar butan frofre &\nSwa hit awriten stonde\u00fe & \u00feus cweden.\nSe salmscop us sang \u00feysne cwide be dea\u00fees onlicnesse & be helle gryre.\n\u00d0onne syndon \u00fereo dea\u00feas leornode on bocum: an \u00feara dea\u00fea bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t mon swelte on his synnum;\n\u00d0onne sindon \u00fereo lif leornode on bocum be so\u00fef\u00e6stum monnum: an lif him bi\u00f0 be fl\u00e6sce; & o\u00f0er him\n& se dea\u00fe is to ondr\u00e6danne for \u00feon n\u00e6nig mon nis \u00fe\u00e6t hine m\u00e6ge befleon.\n\u00deeah se mon eardige on middum burgum & on middan his m\u00e6g\u00fee betweoh hundteontigum \u00feusenda\n& se dea\u00fe is iunglic, for \u00feon \u00fee cild swelta\u00fe & unmagan, & he is freolic & \u00feeowlic, for \u00feon cyningas\n\u00de\u00e6t is wel wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t he sy unrot \u00fe\u00e6m synfullum for \u00fe\u00e6m him n\u00e6fre \u00e6fter ne cuma\u00fe ne beforan ne\n& se dea\u00f0 bi\u00f0 bli\u00f0e halgum mannum for \u00feon gesceade wi\u00f0 eor\u00fewelum, \u00fee him \u00e6r w\u00e6ron fr\u00e6mde on\n\u00deonne eal monna cyn ne m\u00e6g wordum as\u00e6cgan ne ariman \u00fe\u00e6s dea\u00fees gryre for \u00fe\u00e6m gedalum \u00fee on\n\u00de\u00e6t \u00e6ryste gescead bi\u00f0 lichomon & saule.\n\u00de\u00e6t bi\u00f0 sy\u00fe\u00f0an uncu\u00fe hw\u00e6\u00feer seo saul gemete\u00fe swa god swa yfel, swa hire gegearwod bi\u00f0 & hire\nFor \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6ghwylcum bi\u00f0 sundorstow geteod \u00fea \u00f0e he him selfa \u00e6r geworhte.\n\u00deonne is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feridde gescead wi\u00f0 eallum eor\u00feweolum.\nAc se dea\u00fe bi\u00f0 egeslic for \u00fe\u00e6re biternesse, for \u00feon he betyne\u00fe \u00fea eagan from gesih\u00fee & \u00fea earan from\nEala, wa \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee his ende \u00feyllic sceal beon.\n\u00deonne syndon fif hella onlicnessa her on worulde leornode on bocum.\nAn is worc noma, for \u00feon an is micel cwealm \u00fee hine tosceade\u00fe & afylle\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t him sy\u00fe\u00f0an ne lyste\u00fe ne\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6fteran helle onlicnesse her on worulde oferyldo nemned, \u00feonne him \u00fea earan adeafia\u00fe\n\u00deonne is \u00fe\u00e6re \u00f0riddan helle onlicnesse dea\u00fe noma; ne are\u00f0 hine metes gifernes ne gestreon ne ricetere.\n\u00deonne is seo feor\u00fee hell byrgen genemned; \u00fe\u00e6s huses hrof is geny\u00ferod for \u00feon hit him site\u00fe onufan on\nSi\u00fe\u00f0an hine mon gebring\u00e6\u00fe \u00e6t ham, hafa\u00fe him \u00feonne sy\u00fe\u00f0an \u00fereo gebeddan, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 greot & molde &\n\u00deonne is \u00fe\u00e6t fifte hell susl nemned, for \u00feon \u00feeah seofun men syn, mid twam & hundteontigum\nHeo is swa micel swa from heofnas hrofe o\u00f0 ni\u00f0er on \u00feas eor\u00fean.\n& \u00feeah \u00fe\u00e6t lengost treow stonde on middangearde on \u00fe\u00e6m hehstan clife o\u00f0\u00f0e munte, & \u00feonne mon\nFor \u00feon wa \u00feam \u00fee beo\u00f0 gel\u00e6dde to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe.\nEala, wa \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee cunnon godspel secgean & Godes folc l\u00e6ran & ne willa\u00fe for heora gemel\u00e6ste.\n\u00de\u00e6m bi\u00f0 wa \u00e6fre geborenum \u00fee hit ne wille mid inneweardre heortan geheran & healdan.\nOn helle bi\u00f0 wop butan frofre, hreownes butan are, \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 \u00feeowdom butan freodome, & unrotnes\nNe bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r cyninges wor\u00feung ne ealdes wur\u00fenes ne iunges hersumnes ne gesibbes lufu for \u00feon sare\nLa hw\u00e6t, we us huru\u00feinga ne ondr\u00e6da\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t we d\u00e6ghw\u00e6mlice geseo\u00fe beforan urum eahum ure\nHw\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne bi\u00f0 sarlic sar & earmlic gedal lices & saule gif se earma innera mon, seo sawul,\nUton us for \u00feon bewarnian \u00fe\u00e6t micle deoful Antecrist mid helle witum, & wuton beon gemyndige\nUton forletan yfel & don god, on \u00feon \u00fee we \u00feuruhteon m\u00e6gen.\nForl\u00e6ten we mor\u00feor & m\u00e6ne a\u00feas & oferhygde, \u00e6feste & andan & idelne gylp & arleasnesse &\n\u00de\u00e6r bi\u00f0 ofergyten ealle \u00fea god \u00fea \u00f0e men on eor\u00fean \u00e6r lufedon.\n\u00deonne is leornod on bocum \u00fe\u00e6t an deoful s\u00e6de anum ancran be helle wite mid hire tintregum.\nHe cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6re \u00fees middangeard eall mid his w\u00e6stmum n\u00e6s \u00feon mara \u00fee se seofo\u00fea d\u00e6l eor\u00fean\n\u00deonne is se mycela garsecg se \u00fee ymbe \u00feas eor\u00fean utan lige\u00f0 swi\u00fee ormetlice mycel & nys \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t deoful to \u00fe\u00e6m ancran: \u00feeah mon \u00feone garsecg mid isernum weallum utan betyne, &\nFor \u00fe\u00e6m is wa \u00feam \u00fee helle gesece\u00f0, & bi\u00f0 wel \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee hi forg\u00e6\u00fe & mote heofona rice gesecean,\n\u00de\u00e6r bi\u00f0 lif butan dea\u00fee & iugo\u00fe butan yldo & h\u00e6lo butan sare & d\u00e6g buton nihte.\nNe \u00feearf mon \u00fe\u00e6r leohtes sunnan ac \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 leoht genoh of \u00e6lmihtegum dryhtne geond eal heofna\n\u00de\u00e6r beo\u00fe \u00fea wuldorlican sangas ealra \u00f0rymma.\n\u00de\u00e6r n\u00e6fre ne bi\u00f0 ne hungor ne \u00feurst, ne cyle ne gryre, ne bryne ne broga, ne atol ne yld, ne granung\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t deoful to \u00fe\u00e6m ancran: \u00deeah sm\u00e6tegylden mor sy \u00e6t sunnan upgange on neorxnawonge,\n\u00deonne so\u00f0lice ure drihten is to \u00feon mildheort & we syndon him to \u00feon leofe gif we tala do\u00fe & wel\nSwa he seolfa cw\u00e6\u00fe: Nelle ic \u00fe\u00e6s synfullan monnes dea\u00fe, ac ic wille \u00fe\u00e6t he leofge & sy gecyrred\nFor \u00feon \u00feam \u00fee butan andetnessa & butan d\u00e6dbote heora lif geendia\u00fe her on worulde, \u00feonne ne\nUton we \u00feonne geearnian, \u00fea hwile \u00fee us God \u00feisses lifes geunnan will\u00e6, \u00fe\u00e6t we ne syn \u00e6fre mid",
